\title{Gaussian Blobs Cluster Task Generator}
\description{
A \link[mlr3:TaskGenerator]{TaskGenerator} for isotropic Gaussian blobs, in the spirit of
\code{sklearn.datasets.make_blobs()}.
\code{k} cluster centers are drawn uniformly from the hypercube \verb{[-center_box, center_box]^d}, and the \code{n}
observations are assigned to the centers in a balanced fashion and perturbed with Gaussian noise of standard
deviation \code{sd} in each of the \code{d} dimensions.
The generated \link{TaskClust} only contains the numeric features \code{x1}, ..., \code{xd}; the cluster membership is not
stored in the task.
}
